Steam Enhanced, client/friends/dock/ui.js: the Friends dock folds to its rail on windows of 1600 px
and under (was 1400).

Why. With the dock open (~290 px), the game list (~300 px) and the left rail (60 px), a 1600×900
window or a 1920×1080 screen at 125 % scale (1536 px of window) left the page ~890-945 px: the game
page's play bar wrapped its stats onto a second line, its links did not fit, the Home board went to
its narrow layout. A full HD window at 100 % (1920) keeps the open dock.

What. DOCK_FOLD_AT 1400 → 1600. Nothing else changes: opening the dock by hand on a small window
still holds it open until the window crosses the breakpoint, and the saved choice is only changed on
a big window.

